ty supporter but you don't mind the  liberal democrats  if you know that the lib dems have a  better chance of winning in your  constituency  you might vote for them instead of the  green party  that way even though your favorite  hasn't been elected you're still  quite like your mp this way of tactical  voting is more coordinated than ever  before  because of you guessed it brexit  instead of voting for parties some  people are saying they will tactically  vote for policies  most notably a second referendum  some people might think that tactical  voting is a fairly cynical way of taking  part in an election  but more people than ever say they've  done it and it could become an  even bigger feature in future elections  and that's tactical voting  in three minutes
 

